{c: Verse 1}
[Bm] Asmaan tu [Em] mera,        [A] Ya hai mera [D] Khuda
[Bm] Dekhta hun [Em] jahaan,        Tu hi [A] tu, tu hi [F#] tu
Teri [Bm] duniya se to [Em] kya,        [A] Deen se bhi [D] gaya
[Bm] Ek kalma [Em] mera,        Tu hi [A] tu, tu hi [F#] tu
[Em] Kaanch [A] ki [D] titliyaan,        Thi [G] yeh [Em] nazdeekiyaan
Rooth [F#] ke reh [Bm] gaye,        [Em] Dhoop [A] mein [D] pattiyaan
Mom [G] ki [Em] battiyaan,        Bann ke [F#] jalta [Bm] raha
Jal ke [F#] bujh gaya,        [Bm] Asmaan tu [Em] mera
[A] Yaa hai mera [D] Khuda,        [Bm] Dekhta hoon [Em] jahaan
Tu hi [A] tu, tu hi [F#] tu,        Teri [Bm] duniya se to [Em] kya
